WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.501
-You guys, I read about
a new COVID variant

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:03.501
that has some people worried.

00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:07.567
It's called XBB.1.5.

00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:09.400
I guess they couldn't think of
a catchier name.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.567
And it actually inspired me
to write a tiny song.

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:14.133
Roots?
♪♪

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.067
-♪ There was Alpha, then Delta ♪

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:21.634
♪ Then Omicron next ♪

00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:25.200
♪ But this latest variant
might be the best ♪

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.801
♪ It's XBB.1.5 ♪

00:00:28.801 --> 00:00:32.133
♪ Another brand of COVID-19
has arrived ♪

00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:33.934
♪ It's a new strain ♪

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:35.901
♪ But it isn't the same ♪

00:00:35.901 --> 00:00:39.267
♪ Sounds more like
Elon Musk's kid's name ♪

00:00:39.267 --> 00:00:42.767
♪ It's XBB.1.5 ♪

00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:46.534
♪ Not UB40,
who sings "Red Red Wine" ♪

00:00:46.534 --> 00:00:50.100
♪ Put on your mask when
you're inside a facility ♪

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:53.501
♪ It could be a robot from
a "Star Wars" trilogy ♪

00:00:53.501 --> 00:00:57.033
♪ It's XBB.1.5 ♪

00:00:57.033 --> 00:01:00.634
♪ Not OMG or MP3 or TCBY ♪

00:01:00.634 --> 00:01:04.100
♪ Or an eye chart made by
a really high guy ♪

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:07.667
♪ Sounds like the password of
your parents' Wi-Fi ♪

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:11.567
♪ It's XBB.1.5 ♪

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:15.133
♪ XBB.1.5 ♪

00:01:15.133 --> 00:01:17.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

